#: ../../production.md:1
msgid "Production checklist"
msgstr "Uhlu lokuhlola lwe-production"

#: ../../production.md:3
msgid ""
"Work through this list before you ship. Each item comes from something "
"that goes wrong in real integrations."
msgstr ""
"Sebenzisa lolu hlu ngaphambi kokuthi ukhiphe uhlelo. Into ngayinye isuselwa "
"kokuthile okungahamba kabi kuma-integration angempela."

#: ../../production.md:5
msgid "Before you deploy"
msgstr "Ngaphambi kokuthi u-deploy"

#: ../../production.md:7
msgid ""
"Store API keys in environment variables or a secrets manager, never in "
"source code."
msgstr ""
"Gcina ama-API keys kuma-environment variables noma ku-secrets manager, "
"hhayi ku-source code."

#: ../../production.md:8
msgid ""
"Never expose a key in a browser or mobile app. Call the API from your own"
" server."
msgstr ""
"Ungalokothi uveze i-key ku-browser noma ku-mobile app. Shayela i-API "
"ku-server yakho."

#: ../../production.md:9
msgid ""
"Set a timeout on every request. Without one, a stalled connection can "
"hang your application."
msgstr ""
"Setha i-timeout kuyo yonke i-request. Ngaphandle kwayo, i-connection "
"emile ingamisa uhlelo lwakho."

#: ../../production.md:10
msgid ""
"Retry `429` and `500` responses and network failures. Do not retry other "
"`4xx` errors."
msgstr ""
"Zama futhi ama-response `429` kanye `500` nama-network failures. "
"Ungazami futhi amanye ama-error e-`4xx`."

#: ../../production.md:11
msgid ""
"Wait for `Retry-After` on a `429`, and use exponential backoff with a "
"little random jitter for everything else."
msgstr ""
"Linda i-`Retry-After` ku-`429`, bese usebenzisa i-exponential backoff "
"ene-random jitter encane kukho konke okunye."

#: ../../production.md:12
msgid "Log the `request_id` of every failed request so support can find it."
msgstr ""
"Faka i-`request_id` yawo wonke ama-request ahlulekile kuma-log ukuze "
"i-support ikwazi ukuwuthola."

#: ../../production.md:13
msgid "Do not log prompts or responses. They may contain personal data."
msgstr ""
"Ungafaki ama-prompts noma ama-responses kuma-log. Angase aqukathe "
"ulwazi lomuntu siqu."

#: ../../production.md:14
msgid "Check `finish_reason`. A value of `length` means the response was cut off."
msgstr ""
"Hlola i-`finish_reason`. Inani elithi `length` lisho ukuthi i-response "
"inqanyuliwe."

#: ../../production.md:15
msgid "Record `usage.total_tokens` so you can see how much each feature uses."
msgstr ""
"Qopha i-`usage.total_tokens` ukuze ubone ukuthi i-feature ngayinye "
"isebenzisa okungakanani."

#: ../../production.md:16
msgid ""
"Choose the `region` on purpose and confirm the `X-Data-Region` header "
"matches what you expect."
msgstr ""
"Khetha i-`region` ngenhloso futhi uqinisekise ukuthi i-header "
"`X-Data-Region` ihambisana nalokho okulindele."

#: ../../production.md:17
msgid ""
"Handle `model_not_found`. Do not assume a model ID will exist forever. "
"List models at startup if you can."
msgstr ""
"Phatha i-`model_not_found`. Ungacabangi ukuthi i-model ID izohlala ikhona "
"unomphela. Bhala uhlu lwama-model ngesikhathi sokuqala uma ukwazi."

#: ../../production.md:18
msgid "Monitor how long requests take, and alert when they get slower."
msgstr ""
"Qapha ukuthi ama-request athatha isikhathi esingakanani, futhi thumela "
"isaziso uma eqala ukuthatha isikhathi eside."

#: ../../production.md:20
msgid "A client that follows the list"
msgstr "I-client elandela lolu hlu"

#: ../../production.md:22
msgid ""
"The repository includes a small Python client that covers the timeout, "
"retry, backoff and logging items. This is its request method."
msgstr ""
"I-repository ine-Python client encane ehlanganisa izinto ze-timeout, "
"retry, backoff kanye ne-logging. Lena indlela yayo ye-request."

#: ../../production.md:29
msgid "A few choices worth pointing out:"
msgstr "Nazi ezinye izinqumo okufanele ziphawulwe:"

#: ../../production.md:31
msgid ""
"It gives up straight away if the server asks for a wait longer than "
"`max_retry_wait`. A request that blocks for a minute is usually worse "
"than a clear failure."
msgstr ""
"Iyeka ngokushesha uma i-server icela ukuthi kulindwe isikhathi eside kune-"
"`max_retry_wait`. I-request evinjelwe umzuzu ngokuvamile iba yimbi "
"kunokwehluleka okucacile."

#: ../../production.md:32
msgid ""
"It logs the status, error type and request ID. It never logs the prompt "
"or the response."
msgstr ""
"Ifaka i-status, i-error type kanye ne-request ID kuma-log. Ayilokothi "
"ifake i-prompt noma i-response kuma-log."

#: ../../production.md:33
msgid ""
"It only retries statuses in `RETRYABLE_STATUS`. A `400` will not succeed "
"on a second attempt, so the client raises it at once."
msgstr ""
"Iphinda izame kuphela ama-status aku-`RETRYABLE_STATUS`. I-`400` ngeke "
"iphumelele ekuzameni kwesibili, ngakho i-client iyiphakamisa ngokushesha."